{
    "version":  "Notebook/1.0",
    "items":  [
                  {
                      "type":  1,
                      "content":  {
                                      "json":  "# AI Cost and Chargeback (Foundry via APIM)\nTokens from `ApiManagementGatewayLlmLog` priced from the **PRICING_CL** rates table (which is refreshed from the Azure Retail Prices API, no hand-edited rate card) and attributed to APIM subscriptions (teams). Set a **discount** (default 0% = list) for effective vs list. Numbers are small here because this is synthetic demo traffic."
                                  },
                      "name":  "header"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  9,
                      "content":  {
                                      "version":  "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                                      "parameters":  [
                                                         {
                                                             "id":  "tr",
                                                             "version":  "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                                                             "name":  "TimeRange",
                                                             "type":  4,
                                                             "isRequired":  true,
                                                             "typeSettings":  {
                                                                                  "selectableValues":  [
                                                                                                           {
                                                                                                               "durationMs":  3600000
                                                                                                           },
                                                                                                           {
                                                                                                               "durationMs":  14400000
                                                                                                           },
                                                                                                           {
                                                                                                               "durationMs":  86400000
                                                                                                           },
                                                                                                           {
                                                                                                               "durationMs":  604800000
                                                                                                           },
                                                                                                           {
                                                                                                               "durationMs":  2592000000
                                                                                                           }
                                                                                                       ]
                                                                              },
                                                             "value":  {
                                                                           "durationMs":  86400000
                                                                       }
                                                         },
                                                         {
                                                             "id":  "edp",
                                                             "version":  "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                                                             "name":  "EDP",
                                                             "label":  "Discount %",
                                                             "type":  2,
                                                             "isRequired":  true,
                                                             "value":  "0",
                                                             "typeSettings":  {
                                                                                  "showDefault":  false
                                                                              },
                                                             "jsonData":  "[{\"value\":\"0\",\"label\":\"0% (list price)\"},{\"value\":\"15\",\"label\":\"15%\"},{\"value\":\"25\",\"label\":\"25%\"},{\"value\":\"35\",\"label\":\"35%\"},{\"value\":\"45\",\"label\":\"45%\"}]"
                                                         }
                                                     ],
                                      "style":  "pills",
                                      "queryType":  0,
                                      "resourceType":  "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
                                  },
                      "name":  "parameters"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  3,
                      "content":  {
                                      "version":  "KqlItem/1.0",
                                      "query":  "let rateCard = PRICING_CL | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by Model | project Model, InputTokensPrice, OutputTokensPrice;let P = ApiManagementGatewayLlmLog\r\n| where DeploymentName != \u0027\u0027\r\n| join kind=leftouter rateCard on $left.DeploymentName == $right.Model\r\n| extend InputTokensPrice = coalesce(InputTokensPrice, 0.0), OutputTokensPrice = coalesce(OutputTokensPrice, 0.0)\r\n| extend CostList = (PromptTokens * InputTokensPrice + CompletionTokens * OutputTokensPrice) / 1000.0\r\n| extend CostEff = CostList * (1 - todouble(\u0027{EDP}\u0027) / 100.0);\r\nlet cl = toscalar(P | summarize sum(CostList));\r\nlet ce = toscalar(P | summarize sum(CostEff));\r\nlet t = toscalar(P | summarize sum(TotalTokens));\r\nlet n = toscalar(P | summarize count());\r\nunion\r\n (print Name=\u0027Effective cost (USD)\u0027, Value=tostring(round(ce, 2)), Order=1),\r\n (print Name=\u0027List cost (USD)\u0027, Value=tostring(round(cl, 2)), Order=2),\r\n (print Name=\u0027Discount applied\u0027, Value=strcat(\u0027{EDP}\u0027, \u0027%\u0027), Order=3),\r\n (print Name=\u0027Total tokens\u0027, Value=tostring(t), Order=4),\r\n (print Name=\u0027Calls\u0027, Value=tostring(n), Order=5),\r\n (print Name=\u0027Cost / 1K tokens (USD)\u0027, Value=tostring(iff(t \u003e 0, round(ce / (todouble(t) / 1000.0), 4), 0.0)), Order=6)\r\n| order by Order asc\r\n| project Name, Value",
                                      "size":  4,
                                      "timeContextFromParameter":  "TimeRange",
                                      "queryType":  0,
                                      "resourceType":  "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                                      "visualization":  "tiles",
                                      "tileSettings":  {
                                                           "titleContent":  {
                                                                                "columnMatch":  "Name",
                                                                                "formatter":  1
                                                                            },
                                                           "leftContent":  {
                                                                               "columnMatch":  "Value",
                                                                               "formatter":  1
                                                                           },
                                                           "showBorder":  true
                                                       }
                                  },
                      "name":  "kpi"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  1,
                      "content":  {
                                      "json":  "## Live token volume (platform metrics, ~1 min)\nSourced from `AzureMetrics` (platform metrics routed to this workspace). Faster than the log tiles below, but model-level only (metrics carry no team dimension). For the true 1-minute view, open **Metrics** on the Foundry resource."
                                  },
                      "name":  "h-live"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  3,
                      "content":  {
                                      "version":  "KqlItem/1.0",
                                      "query":  "AzureMetrics\r\n| where ResourceProvider =~ \u0027MICROSOFT.COGNITIVESERVICES\u0027\r\n| where MetricName in (\u0027TotalTokens\u0027,\u0027InputTokens\u0027,\u0027OutputTokens\u0027)\r\n| summarize Tokens = sum(Total) by bin(TimeGenerated, 1m), MetricName\r\n| order by TimeGenerated asc",
                                      "size":  2,
                                      "queryType":  0,
                                      "resourceType":  "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                                      "visualization":  "timechart"
                                  },
                      "name":  "live-metrics"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  1,
                      "content":  {
                                      "json":  "## Where the money goes (effective cost)"
                                  },
                      "name":  "h-breakdown"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  3,
                      "content":  {
                                      "version":  "KqlItem/1.0",
                                      "query":  "let rateCard = PRICING_CL | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by Model | project Model, InputTokensPrice, OutputTokensPrice;ApiManagementGatewayLlmLog\r\n| where DeploymentName != \u0027\u0027\r\n| join kind=leftouter (ApiManagementGatewayLogs | project CorrelationId, ApimSubscriptionId) on CorrelationId\r\n| join kind=leftouter rateCard on $left.DeploymentName == $right.Model\r\n| extend Team = coalesce(ApimSubscriptionId, \u0027unknown\u0027), PriceMissing = isnull(InputTokensPrice)\r\n| extend InputTokensPrice = coalesce(InputTokensPrice, 0.0), OutputTokensPrice = coalesce(OutputTokensPrice, 0.0)\r\n| extend CostList = (PromptTokens * InputTokensPrice + CompletionTokens * OutputTokensPrice) / 1000.0\r\n| extend CostUSD = CostList * (1 - todouble(\u0027{EDP}\u0027) / 100.0)| summarize [\u0027Cost (USD)\u0027] = round(sum(CostUSD), 4) by DeploymentName\n| order by [\u0027Cost (USD)\u0027] desc",
                                      "size":  1,
                                      "timeContextFromParameter":  "TimeRange",
                                      "queryType":  0,
                                      "resourceType":  "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                                      "visualization":  "barchart"
                                  },
                      "name":  "spend-by-model",
                      "customWidth":  "50"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  3,
                      "content":  {
                                      "version":  "KqlItem/1.0",
                                      "query":  "let rateCard = PRICING_CL | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by Model | project Model, InputTokensPrice, OutputTokensPrice;ApiManagementGatewayLlmLog\r\n| where DeploymentName != \u0027\u0027\r\n| join kind=leftouter (ApiManagementGatewayLogs | project CorrelationId, ApimSubscriptionId) on CorrelationId\r\n| join kind=leftouter rateCard on $left.DeploymentName == $right.Model\r\n| extend Team = coalesce(ApimSubscriptionId, \u0027unknown\u0027), PriceMissing = isnull(InputTokensPrice)\r\n| extend InputTokensPrice = coalesce(InputTokensPrice, 0.0), OutputTokensPrice = coalesce(OutputTokensPrice, 0.0)\r\n| extend CostList = (PromptTokens * InputTokensPrice + CompletionTokens * OutputTokensPrice) / 1000.0\r\n| extend CostUSD = CostList * (1 - todouble(\u0027{EDP}\u0027) / 100.0)| summarize [\u0027Cost (USD)\u0027] = round(sum(CostUSD), 4) by Team\n| order by [\u0027Cost (USD)\u0027] desc",
                                      "size":  1,
                                      "timeContextFromParameter":  "TimeRange",
                                      "queryType":  0,
                                      "resourceType":  "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                                      "visualization":  "barchart"
                                  },
                      "name":  "spend-by-team",
                      "customWidth":  "50"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  1,
                      "content":  {
                                      "json":  "## Spend over time (by model)"
                                  },
                      "name":  "h-trend"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  3,
                      "content":  {
                                      "version":  "KqlItem/1.0",
                                      "query":  "let rateCard = PRICING_CL | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by Model | project Model, InputTokensPrice, OutputTokensPrice;ApiManagementGatewayLlmLog\r\n| where DeploymentName != \u0027\u0027\r\n| join kind=leftouter (ApiManagementGatewayLogs | project CorrelationId, ApimSubscriptionId) on CorrelationId\r\n| join kind=leftouter rateCard on $left.DeploymentName == $right.Model\r\n| extend Team = coalesce(ApimSubscriptionId, \u0027unknown\u0027), PriceMissing = isnull(InputTokensPrice)\r\n| extend InputTokensPrice = coalesce(InputTokensPrice, 0.0), OutputTokensPrice = coalesce(OutputTokensPrice, 0.0)\r\n| extend CostList = (PromptTokens * InputTokensPrice + CompletionTokens * OutputTokensPrice) / 1000.0\r\n| extend CostUSD = CostList * (1 - todouble(\u0027{EDP}\u0027) / 100.0)| summarize [\u0027Cost (USD)\u0027] = round(sum(CostUSD), 4) by bin(TimeGenerated, 5m), DeploymentName",
                                      "size":  2,
                                      "timeContextFromParameter":  "TimeRange",
                                      "queryType":  0,
                                      "resourceType":  "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                                      "visualization":  "timechart"
                                  },
                      "name":  "trend"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  1,
                      "content":  {
                                      "json":  "## Spend anomaly detection (actual vs expected, last 24h)"
                                  },
                      "name":  "h-anomaly"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  3,
                      "content":  {
                                      "version":  "KqlItem/1.0",
                                      "query":  "let rateCard = PRICING_CL | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by Model | project Model, InputTokensPrice, OutputTokensPrice;ApiManagementGatewayLlmLog\r\n| where DeploymentName != \u0027\u0027\r\n| join kind=leftouter rateCard on $left.DeploymentName == $right.Model\r\n| extend InputTokensPrice = coalesce(InputTokensPrice, 0.0), OutputTokensPrice = coalesce(OutputTokensPrice, 0.0)\r\n| extend CostUSD = ((PromptTokens * InputTokensPrice + CompletionTokens * OutputTokensPrice) / 1000.0) * (1 - todouble(\u0027{EDP}\u0027) / 100.0)\r\n| make-series Spend = sum(CostUSD) default=0 on TimeGenerated from ago(1d) to now() step 30m\r\n| extend (anomalies, score, baseline) = series_decompose_anomalies(Spend, 1.5)\r\n| mv-expand TimeGenerated to typeof(datetime), Spend to typeof(double), baseline to typeof(double)\r\n| project TimeGenerated, [\u0027Actual spend (USD)\u0027] = Spend, [\u0027Expected (baseline)\u0027] = baseline",
                                      "size":  2,
                                      "queryType":  0,
                                      "resourceType":  "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                                      "visualization":  "timechart"
                                  },
                      "name":  "anomaly"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  1,
                      "content":  {
                                      "json":  "## Budget vs actual (per team)"
                                  },
                      "name":  "h-budget"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  3,
                      "content":  {
                                      "version":  "KqlItem/1.0",
                                      "query":  "let rateCard = PRICING_CL | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by Model | project Model, InputTokensPrice, OutputTokensPrice;ApiManagementGatewayLlmLog\r\n| where DeploymentName != \u0027\u0027\r\n| join kind=leftouter (ApiManagementGatewayLogs | project CorrelationId, ApimSubscriptionId) on CorrelationId\r\n| join kind=leftouter rateCard on $left.DeploymentName == $right.Model\r\n| extend Team = coalesce(ApimSubscriptionId, \u0027unknown\u0027), PriceMissing = isnull(InputTokensPrice)\r\n| extend InputTokensPrice = coalesce(InputTokensPrice, 0.0), OutputTokensPrice = coalesce(OutputTokensPrice, 0.0)\r\n| extend CostList = (PromptTokens * InputTokensPrice + CompletionTokens * OutputTokensPrice) / 1000.0\r\n| extend CostUSD = CostList * (1 - todouble(\u0027{EDP}\u0027) / 100.0)| summarize CostUSD = sum(CostUSD) by Team\r\n| join kind=inner (SUBSCRIPTION_QUOTA_CL | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by Subscription | project Team = Subscription, CostQuota) on Team\r\n| extend PctUsed = round(100.0 * CostUSD / CostQuota, 1)\r\n| extend Status = case(PctUsed \u003e= 100, \u0027OVER BUDGET\u0027, PctUsed \u003e= 80, \u0027Warning\u0027, \u0027OK\u0027)\r\n| project Team, [\u0027Spend (USD)\u0027] = round(CostUSD, 4), [\u0027Quota (USD)\u0027] = CostQuota, [\u0027% used\u0027] = PctUsed, Status\r\n| order by [\u0027% used\u0027] desc",
                                      "size":  2,
                                      "timeContextFromParameter":  "TimeRange",
                                      "queryType":  0,
                                      "resourceType":  "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                                      "visualization":  "table"
                                  },
                      "name":  "budget"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  1,
                      "content":  {
                                      "json":  "## Data quality: deployments with no rate-card entry (PRICE MISSING)\nThese calls are counted but priced at 0 because no PRICING_CL row matches the deployment name. Empty table = every model is priced."
                                  },
                      "name":  "h-unmapped"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  3,
                      "content":  {
                                      "version":  "KqlItem/1.0",
                                      "query":  "let rateCard = PRICING_CL | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by Model | project Model, InputTokensPrice, OutputTokensPrice;ApiManagementGatewayLlmLog\r\n| where DeploymentName != \u0027\u0027\r\n| join kind=leftouter (ApiManagementGatewayLogs | project CorrelationId, ApimSubscriptionId) on CorrelationId\r\n| join kind=leftouter rateCard on $left.DeploymentName == $right.Model\r\n| extend Team = coalesce(ApimSubscriptionId, \u0027unknown\u0027), PriceMissing = isnull(InputTokensPrice)\r\n| extend InputTokensPrice = coalesce(InputTokensPrice, 0.0), OutputTokensPrice = coalesce(OutputTokensPrice, 0.0)\r\n| extend CostList = (PromptTokens * InputTokensPrice + CompletionTokens * OutputTokensPrice) / 1000.0\r\n| extend CostUSD = CostList * (1 - todouble(\u0027{EDP}\u0027) / 100.0)| where PriceMissing\n| summarize Calls = count(), [\u0027Unpriced tokens\u0027] = sum(TotalTokens) by DeploymentName\n| order by Calls desc",
                                      "size":  1,
                                      "timeContextFromParameter":  "TimeRange",
                                      "queryType":  0,
                                      "resourceType":  "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                                      "visualization":  "table"
                                  },
                      "name":  "unmapped"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  1,
                      "content":  {
                                      "json":  "## Token split and top consumers"
                                  },
                      "name":  "h-detail"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  3,
                      "content":  {
                                      "version":  "KqlItem/1.0",
                                      "query":  "let rateCard = PRICING_CL | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by Model | project Model, InputTokensPrice, OutputTokensPrice;ApiManagementGatewayLlmLog\r\n| where DeploymentName != \u0027\u0027\r\n| join kind=leftouter (ApiManagementGatewayLogs | project CorrelationId, ApimSubscriptionId) on CorrelationId\r\n| join kind=leftouter rateCard on $left.DeploymentName == $right.Model\r\n| extend Team = coalesce(ApimSubscriptionId, \u0027unknown\u0027), PriceMissing = isnull(InputTokensPrice)\r\n| extend InputTokensPrice = coalesce(InputTokensPrice, 0.0), OutputTokensPrice = coalesce(OutputTokensPrice, 0.0)\r\n| extend CostList = (PromptTokens * InputTokensPrice + CompletionTokens * OutputTokensPrice) / 1000.0\r\n| extend CostUSD = CostList * (1 - todouble(\u0027{EDP}\u0027) / 100.0)| summarize [\u0027Prompt tokens\u0027] = sum(PromptTokens), [\u0027Completion tokens\u0027] = sum(CompletionTokens) by DeploymentName\n| order by [\u0027Prompt tokens\u0027] desc",
                                      "size":  1,
                                      "timeContextFromParameter":  "TimeRange",
                                      "queryType":  0,
                                      "resourceType":  "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                                      "visualization":  "barchart"
                                  },
                      "name":  "token-split",
                      "customWidth":  "40"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  3,
                      "content":  {
                                      "version":  "KqlItem/1.0",
                                      "query":  "let rateCard = PRICING_CL | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by Model | project Model, InputTokensPrice, OutputTokensPrice;ApiManagementGatewayLlmLog\r\n| where DeploymentName != \u0027\u0027\r\n| join kind=leftouter (ApiManagementGatewayLogs | project CorrelationId, ApimSubscriptionId) on CorrelationId\r\n| join kind=leftouter rateCard on $left.DeploymentName == $right.Model\r\n| extend Team = coalesce(ApimSubscriptionId, \u0027unknown\u0027), PriceMissing = isnull(InputTokensPrice)\r\n| extend InputTokensPrice = coalesce(InputTokensPrice, 0.0), OutputTokensPrice = coalesce(OutputTokensPrice, 0.0)\r\n| extend CostList = (PromptTokens * InputTokensPrice + CompletionTokens * OutputTokensPrice) / 1000.0\r\n| extend CostUSD = CostList * (1 - todouble(\u0027{EDP}\u0027) / 100.0)| summarize Calls = count(), [\u0027Input tokens\u0027] = sum(PromptTokens), [\u0027Output tokens\u0027] = sum(CompletionTokens), [\u0027List (USD)\u0027] = round(sum(CostList), 4), [\u0027Effective (USD)\u0027] = round(sum(CostUSD), 4) by Team, DeploymentName\n| order by [\u0027Effective (USD)\u0027] desc",
                                      "size":  1,
                                      "timeContextFromParameter":  "TimeRange",
                                      "queryType":  0,
                                      "resourceType":  "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                                      "visualization":  "table"
                                  },
                      "name":  "top-consumers",
                      "customWidth":  "60"
                  },
                  {
                      "type":  1,
                      "content":  {
                                      "json":  "## Quality and safety: turn spend into unit economics\nNo Foundry evaluation or Purview DLP data is flowing yet. Once you run Foundry evals or Purview DLP at the gateway, add a **cost per passing eval** tile and a **spend-at-risk** tile. Runnable join queries are in the [foundry-cost-roi-dashboard](https://github.com/rebmid/foundry-cost-roi-dashboard) README (Governance section)."
                                  },
                      "name":  "h-quality"
                  }
              ],
    "isLocked":  false,
    "fallbackResourceIds":  [
                                "{workspace-id}"
                            ],
    "$schema":  "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json"
}
